OL,3,GNEWSADeaths of distressed pilot whales
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of three of five stranded
OL,7,Fpilot whales has been described as
OL,8,F"devastating" by a marine researcher.
OL,10,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,11,F(BDMLR) was alerted to a pod of about
OL,12,F40 distressed whales near to the shore
OL,13,Fin Amble, Northumberland, at 15:00 BST
OL,14,Fon Sunday.
OL,16,FThe BDMLR said it was not the same pod
OL,17,Fof whales herded out of the River
OL,18,FThames at the weekend as the distance
OL,19,Fbetween locations was further than the
OL,20,Fspecies could swim in 24 hours.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
