OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADeaths of distressed pilot whales
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearcher Lavinia Mitchell said it
OL,7,F"really stood out how unusual it was to
OL,8,Fhave these pilot whales turning up in
OL,9,Fshallow waters at the same time" when
OL,10,Fthey were normally found in deeper
OL,11,Foffshore waters.
